    {
      "id": "9afcd532ed73cc83",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Yo hi koci manussesu, gāmaṃ raṭṭhañca bhuñjati.\n\n# evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, rājā eso na brāhmaṇo.",
