      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 1370,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "c724e2a9af6b4fdc",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# manussesu",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "144a830a40e0ce7b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# brāhmaṇo.\nBa-la-môn",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "b1f1a30dc00f6432",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# yo\nĐTNX",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1210,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "6f145685244b219d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# manussesu",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 780,
      "y": 4095,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "06292ada401300f9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# upajīvati\nĐộng + ACC\n**Sinh sống bằng**\n",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 1170,
      "y": 3840,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "27c62ded82e7d178",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Đoạn kinh 2 (MN)\n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, gorakkhaṃ upajīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, kassako so na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, puthusippena jīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, sippiko so na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, vohāraṃ upajīvati. \n ## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, vāṇijo so na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, parapessena jīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, pessiko so na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, adinnaṃ upajīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, coro eso na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, issatthaṃ upajīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, yodhājīvo na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, porohiccena jīvati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, yājako so na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Yo hi koci manussesu, gāmaṃ raṭṭhañca bhuñjati. \n## evaṃ Vāseṭṭha jānāhi, rājā eso na brāhmaṇo. \n\n## Na cāhaṃ brāhmaṇaṃ brūmi, yonijaṃ mattisambhavaṃ. \n## Bhovādi nāma so hoti, sace hoti sakiñcano. \n\n## Akiñcanaṃ anādānaṃ, tamahaṃ brūmi brāhmaṇaṃ. \n## Sabbasaṃyojanaṃ chetvā, yo ve na paritassati. \n## Saṅgātigaṃ visaṃyuttaṃ, taṃ ahaṃ brūmi brāhmaṇaṃ. \n",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -700,
      "y": -560,
      "width": 1080,
      "height": 1080
    },
    {
      "id": "244787d774f9d5a6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Koci",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -420,
      "y": 680,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 60
    },
    {
      "id": "9f3b44b2c4d20777",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# yo\nĐTNX",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -290,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "3046bfe6f7271c90",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Bất kì ai trong loài người",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": -420,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 390,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "771790dad3e21cd3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Này vāseṭṭha, hãy biết như vầy",
      "styleAttributes": {},
      "x": 740,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
